    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43496" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔβᾰτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>accessible, passable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ γὰρ εὔ. περᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					718
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιεῖν τι εὔ. τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					761a
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώτερος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				4.6.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of dwarf
			fig-trees, in 
				Comp.
			, <i>more accessible</i> or <i>manageable</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				2.6.12
			</span></i>.</div>
